# Text corpus derived from the frozen packs for AI reviews: committed with its manifest of hashes so the
# review workflow in GitHub Actions reads the same bytes the local reviews read.

# Raw reviewer event streams are large and derived; the review record and response are what count
docs/product/gold-cases/reviews/**/codex-events.jsonl
